# Session op logs (`sessions/<yyyy>/<ulid>.jsonl`), graph ops (`nodes.jsonl`,
# `edges.jsonl`, `checks.jsonl`, `topics.json`) and `frontier.jsonl` are append-only:
# every line is one independent record, so a merge that keeps both sides' lines is
# always correct. Git-based sync will rely on this; without it a branch-and-join
# workflow conflicts on every appended record.
*.jsonl merge=union

# Docs, prompts and design notes are hand-written text: same bytes, same diff, on
# every OS. Prompts are bundled at build time, so a CRLF checkout would also change
# what the model is sent.
*.md text eol=lf

# Generated; never worth reading in a diff.
Cargo.lock -diff

# Icons are binary; keep them out of text diffs and merges.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
